# App-only routes get the SPA shell. Every indexable page (blog, tools, marketing, templates, pricing) is prerendered
# to a real file by scripts/build-seo.ts, and files win over these rewrites. There is deliberately NO /* catch-all:
# with a root 404.html, Cloudflare Pages returns a real 404 for unknown URLs instead of a 200 soft-404.
/signin       /  200
/signup       /  200
/help         /  200
/terms        /  200
/privacy      /  200
/preview/*    /  200
